<Base title="Menu | Garahean Diners" description="Fresh lutong bahay daily at Garahean Diners: bistek, menudo, lechon kawali, pancit, lumpia, fried chicken and mixed fruits." path="/menu.html" ogImage="lechon-kawali" current="menu">
<section class="hero hero-page" style="background-image:url(images/lechon-kawali.webp)"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Cooked fresh every morning</p><h1>Our Menu</h1><p>Fresh lutong bahay daily. Dishes change every day, so check our Facebook page for today's line-up.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="center intro"><p class="eyebrow">Menu</p><h2>Lutong Bahay Classics</h2><p>Home-style ulam cooked fresh every morning.</p></div><div class="grid g3"><div class="card"><img src="images/bistek.webp" alt="Bistek" loading="lazy"><h3>Bistek</h3><p>Tender beef in soy-calamansi sauce topped with onion rings.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/menudo.webp" alt="Menudo" loading="lazy"><h3>Menudo</h3><p>Pork stewed in tomato sauce with carrots and potatoes.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/tinola.webp" alt="Tinola" loading="lazy"><h3>Tinola</h3><p>Comforting chicken soup with ginger, sayote and greens.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/ginataan.webp" alt="Ginataan" loading="lazy"><h3>Ginataan</h3><p>Rich, creamy dishes slow-cooked in coconut milk.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/braised-pork.webp" alt="Braised Pork" loading="lazy"><h3>Braised Pork</h3><p>Melt-in-your-mouth pork simmered in a savoury sauce.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/tomato-stew.webp" alt="Tomato Stew" loading="lazy"><h3>Tomato Stew</h3><p>Hearty meat stew with bell peppers in tomato sauce.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec cream"><div class="wrap"><div class="center intro"><p class="eyebrow">Menu</p><h2>From the Fryer & Grill</h2><p>Crispy, smoky and made to share.</p></div><div class="grid g3"><div class="card"><img src="images/lechon-kawali.webp" alt="Lechon Kawali" loading="lazy"><h3>Lechon Kawali</h3><p>Crispy deep-fried pork belly.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/roast-chicken.webp" alt="Roast Chicken" loading="lazy"><h3>Roast Chicken</h3><p>Golden roasted chicken, juicy to the bone.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/pork-barbecue.webp" alt="Pork Barbecue" loading="lazy"><h3>Pork Barbecue</h3><p>Grilled skewers with a sweet glaze.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/sweet-spicy-chicken.webp" alt="Sweet &amp; Spicy Chicken" loading="lazy"><h3>Sweet & Spicy Chicken</h3><p>Fried chicken tossed in a sticky chilli glaze.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/fried-chicken.webp" alt="Fried Chicken" loading="lazy"><h3>Fried Chicken</h3><p>Crunchy breaded fried chicken.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/lumpia-tray.webp" alt="Lumpia" loading="lazy"><h3>Lumpia</h3><p>Crispy spring rolls, by the piece or by the tray.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="center intro"><p class="eyebrow">Menu</p><h2>Noodles, Veggies & More</h2><p>Good food for every day of the week.</p></div><div class="grid g3"><div class="card"><img src="images/pancit.webp" alt="Pancit" loading="lazy"><h3>Pancit</h3><p>Stir-fried noodles with meat and vegetables.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/vegetable-stir-fry.webp" alt="Vegetable Stir-fry" loading="lazy"><h3>Vegetable Stir-fry</h3><p>Fresh, crunchy vegetables with savoury sauce.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/pork-stir-fry.webp" alt="Pork Stir-fry" loading="lazy"><h3>Pork Stir-fry</h3><p>Pork strips sauteed with vegetables.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/roast-pork.webp" alt="Roast Pork" loading="lazy"><h3>Roast Pork</h3><p>Sliced roast pork, a party favourite.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec cream"><div class="wrap"><div class="center intro"><p class="eyebrow">Menu</p><h2>Fruits & Refreshers</h2><p>Light, sweet and healthy.</p></div><div class="grid g3"><div class="card"><img src="images/mixed-fruits.webp" alt="Mixed Fruits Cup" loading="lazy"><h3>Mixed Fruits Cup</h3><p>Our all-time favourite, very affordable and healthy.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/mixed-fruits-cup.webp" alt="Fruit Salad Cup" loading="lazy"><h3>Fruit Salad Cup</h3><p>Chilled fruit with cream, perfect for warm days.</p></div><div class="card"><img src="images/mangoes.webp" alt="Fresh Mangoes" loading="lazy"><h3>Fresh Mangoes</h3><p>Sweet local mangoes when in season.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="hero band" style="background-image:url(images/buffet-trays-2.webp)"><div class="wrap"><h2>Menu changes daily</h2><p>We post the day's dishes on Facebook every morning. Call ahead to reserve trays or packed meals for pickup.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://www.facebook.com/garahean/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i> See today's menu on Facebook</a></div></section>
